g", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": true, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>Note as of Aug 27, 2024 - the original post has been updated to accommodate the lower onchain proposal threshold of 1m UNI as adjusted in <a href=\"https://vote.uniswapfoundation.org/proposals/55\">this vote</a>. Note that the graphic still says 2.5m UNI - will get that changed as well.</p>", "created_at": "2024-08-27T16:31:59.649Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "display_username": null, "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 53808, "incoming_link_count": 3, "link_counts": [{"clicks": 49, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Lower Onchain Proposal Threshold", "url": "https://vote.uniswapfoundation.org/proposals/55"}], "moderator": false, "name": null, "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/community-governance-process-update-jan-2023/19976/9", "posts_count": 5, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 6, "reactions": [{"count": 6, "id": "heart", "type": "emoji"}], "read": true, "readers_count": 253, "reads": 254, "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "score": 160.6, "staff": true, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 19976, "topic_slug": "community-governance-process-update-jan-2023", "trust_level": 4, "updated_at": "2024-08-27T16:31:59.649Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 10687, "user_title": "", "username": "eek637", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}, {"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [{"count": 7, "id": 2}], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/gov.uniswap.org/jayyu23/{size}/8583_2.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": true, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/eek637\">@eek637</a> Can you also get someone to change this page, which still shows the Consensus check?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.uniswap.org/concepts/governance/process\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.uniswap.org/concepts/governance/process</a></p>", "created_at": "2024-09-05T06:15:10.273Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "display_username": "Jay Yu | Stanford Blockchain", "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 53881, "incoming_link_count": 79, "link_counts": [{"clicks": 107, "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Process | Uniswap", "url": "https://docs.uniswap.org/concepts/governance/process"}], "moderator": false, "name": "Jay Yu | Stanford Blockchain", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/community-governance-process-update-jan-2023/19976/10", "posts_count": 5, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 7, "reactions": [{"count": 7, "id": "heart", "type": "emoji"}], "read": true, "readers_count": 246, "reads": 247, "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 9, "reply_to_user": {"avatar_template": "/user_avatar/gov.uniswap.org/eek637/{size}/7037_2.png", "id": 10687, "name": null, "username": "eek637"}, "score": 579.2, "staff": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null, "topic_id": 19976, "topic_slug": "community-governance-process-update-jan-2023", "trust_level": 2, "updated_at": "2024-09-05T06:15:10.273Z", "user_deleted": false, "user_id": 17018, "user_title": "", "username": "jayyu23", "version": 1, "wiki": false, "yours": false}, {"accepted_answer": false, "actions_summary": [{"count": 2, "id": 2}], "admin": false, "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/ecc23a/{size}.png", "badges_granted": [], "bookmarked": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "can_view_edit_history": true, "can_wiki": false, "cooked": "<p>Hi Uniswap community,</p>\n<p>I’m part of the team that built the Discourse widget for Aave, which displays live vote status directly inside forum discussions (quorum progress, countdown timers, results). This allows delegates to immediately see when a proposal is live for voting, without needing to switch between the forum and governance platforms, thereby improving participation and reducing friction.</p>\n<p>We believe Uniswap would benefit from a similar integration to bridge the gap between forum debate and Agora/Tally votes. <strong>Who is the right person or working group to speak with about a potential integration?</strong> Tagging <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/eek637\">@eek637</a> and the <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/uniswapfoundation\">@UniswapFoundation</a> for guidance.<br>\nThanks</p>", "created_at": "2026-01-09T14:16:48.718Z", "current_user_reaction": null, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "deleted_at": null, "display_username": "David Len", "edit_reason": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "hidden": false, "id": 58164, "incoming_link_count": 55, "moderator": false, "name": "David Len", "post_number": 11, "post_type": 1, "post_url": "/t/community-governance-process-update-jan-2023/19976/11", "posts_count": 5, "primary_group_name": null, "quote_count": 0, "reaction_users_count": 2, "reactions": [{"count": 2, "id": "heart", "type": "emoji"}], "read": true, "readers_count": 67, "reads": 68, "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "score": 318.4, "staff": false, "topic